=== Let your light shine
--- Let your light so shine [title]
overline: The walk
heading: Let Your Light So Shine
big: Matthew 5:16 | mark: Let your light so shine before men
center: When you reach the point where your Christianity isn't about you at all, but about God, glorifying Him in service of others, you are reaching perfection.
